BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Horsegirls
DTSTART:20260725T203000Z
DTEND:20260725T223000Z
DTSTAMP:20260725T203000Z
UID:mt4ohquWLx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nHorsegirls is the story of 22-y
 ear-old Margarita\, a young woman with autism\, who discovers the world o
 f hobbyhorsing and sets out to prove her independence to her mother—stic
 k horse and all. Encouraged by a supportive coach\, her mom\, and her comm
 unity\, Margarita gains confidence to forge her own path.\n\nhttps://www.s
 iff.net/cinema/in-theaters/horsegirls\n\nEstimated start: 13:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
