BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wild Inside
DTSTART:20260808T014500Z
DTEND:20260808T033500Z
DTSTAMP:20260808T014500Z
UID:4skZblTG9G
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nScreening August 4 at SIFF Cinema
  Uptown for International Owl Awareness Day\, then at the SIFF Film Center
  August 7-9. A Eurasian Eagle-Owl named Flaco escapes from the Central Pa
 rk Zoo and sets off on a magical odyssey through the island of Manhattan. 
 Flaco overcomes his years of captivity and lack of survival skills to answ
 er the call of the wild – and discovers he was wild inside all along.\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/wild-inside\n\nEstimated start: 1
 9:00
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
